7. Optimal Approach (Binary Search + DAG Shortest Path DP)

Intuition

Suppose minimum edge should be at least X.

Then

Ignore every edge

having cost<X

Remaining graph still remains DAG.

Now simply compute

Shortest path

using Topological Order.

If shortest path cost≤k,

then X is feasible.

Otherwise it is impossible.

Binary Search gives the maximum X.


